<title>CHILE: Entel Chile 1996 net falls.</title>
<headline>Entel Chile 1996 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecom Entel Chile SA reported the following results last year.</p>
<p>				  1996		 1995</p>
<p>Net profit			6.08    profit  10.95</p>
<p>Operating profit	     17.52    profit  14.03</p>
<p>Non-operating loss	   10.76	loss   1.81</p>
<p>Revenues			135.18	     121.76</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures are in billions of pesos.</p>
<p>((-- Margaret Orgill, Santiago newsroom, 562-699-5595x212))</p>
</text>
